<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS AND USAGE ELINEST TM is indicated for use by females of reproductive potential to prevent pregnancy. In a study of 1,287 women with a total of 11,085 cycles or 852.7 women-years of usage, the pregnancy rate in women age 15 to 40 years was approximately 1 pregnancy per 100 women-years of use.</Data></Cell>
