<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE Labetalol Hydrochloride is indicated in the management of hypertension, to lower blood pressure. Lowering blood pressure reduces the risk of fatal and nonfatal cardiovascular events, primarily strokes and myocardial infarctions. These benefits have been seen in controlled trials of antihypertensive drugs from a wide variety of pharmacologic classes including beta adrenergic blockers. Control of high blood pressure should be part of comprehensive cardiovascular risk manageme...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
