<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1. INDICATIONS AND USAGE Meloxicam tablets are a non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drug indicated for: Osteoarthritis (OA) ( 1.1 ) Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA) ( 1.2 ) 1.1 Osteoarthritis (OA) Meloxicam tablets are indicated for relief of the signs and symptoms of osteoarthritis [ see Clinical Studies (14.1) ]. 1.2 Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA) Meloxicam tablet are indicated for relief of the signs and symptoms of rheumatoid arthritis [ see Clinical Studies (14.1) ].</Data></Cell>
