<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE Thiothixene capsules are effective in the management of schizophrenia. Thiothixene capsules have not been evaluated in the management of behavioral complications in patients with mental retardation.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
